      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start. one of the directors is going to argue that we have a fiduciary duty to the shareholders to prioritize returns above everything else, and that social justice stuff is just a distraction or even a breach of that duty. how should I respond to the argument that focusing on these social issues is fundamentally at odds with our responsibility to maximize profit?",
