      "content": "that makes sense. but some of them are saying that even if it's \"long term,\" it's still just taking money away from shareholders right now to fund social agendas that are basically just political activism. they're calling it \"woke capitalism\" and saying it's just a way for CEOs to feel good about themselves instead of running a business. is there a way to address the idea that this is just political posturing rather than actual business strategy?",
